A||||19||fogglethorpe||hangover remedy||||1||
Z||000000||fogglethorpe||09-02-2001||08:34 AM||||Don't drink too much! (That's one)<P>But, for those who over-indulge, I have a concoction, an elixir if you will, that will fix you up.<BR>Ideally, this should be made in a blender, but the whirring of its motor may be a little much for those with a severe headache.<P>-In measuring cup, pour in 4oz. WARM Coca Cola<BR>-Add 1 heaping teaspoon instant coffee (not decaf.)<BR>-Add app. 2oz. warm water<BR>-Add 2 crushed Ibuprofen tablets<BR>-Mix well, consume immediately<P>Warning...this stuff will taste kind of nasty, but you will be feeling better soon.<P>Also, this is for less severe hangovers...If you spent the evening in the bathroom, and others had to move your head out of the way to pee, don't get your hopes up.<P>If anyone out there tries this, I would appreciate feedback.<P>Cheers...<BR><P>------------------<BR>I don't think so;therefore, I'm probably not.||||reg||1
