Z||000004||JSocha||09-02-2001||02:09 PM||||When I was 18, was at my grandma's funeral in Winnipeg, my cousin Kelly and her boyfriend and a good looking friend took me out to the bars and some parties the night before we were going to leave.<P>Got stinky drunk I tell you.  Ended up being thrown in the back trunk area of my cousins '70 something HONDA civic (the ones that look like the VW rabbit).<P>Next morning, woke up to her friend (beautiful site to wake up to let me tell yah  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smile.gif"> ) with one gawd awfull hangover with a Berlin bomb raid going off in my head and the first atomic attack on Japan...that is how bad it was.  Made it through 1 1/2 "Atom Bombs", a drink in a 16oz glass.  Nobody ever made it through 3.  Pure liquor!  And I was already drunk when we arrived.  That was the last thing I remember that evening.  Downing one.  Then downing 1/2 the other one, handing it to my cousin's friend...then nothing else...total black out.<P>Anyways, she went upstairs that morning and made me a hangover remdy and made me drink it.  WORKED!  Made me puke my guts out (she warned me) and shortly thereafter, I was hunky dory, just a little dehydrated and drinking lots and lots of milk, water and pop.  But I did not feel queezy, shaky or tired the rest of the morning.<P>Found out her father was Indian, went out drinking alot and made it regularily for a friend of his.<P>Also found out that if it was mixed wrong, it could kill you, but its sole purpose was to get you to ralph like there was no tomorrow. And believe you me, it did!  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif"> ||||reg||1
Z||000005||Formula88||09-02-2001||08:21 PM||||Try substituting Ginger Ale for the Coke in your elixir.  The ginger in the Ginger Ale will help to settle your stomach, and everything else works about the same as with Coke.<P>I find that Grapefruit juice the night before helps me avoid one.  And a good, spicy, Bloody Mary in the morning can help smooth out the hangover.  Also, BC powder (or 2) washed down with a beer will kill a headache quicker than anything else I've ever tried.||||reg||1
Z||000006||starfighter007@msn.com||09-02-2001||08:49 PM||||I'm with Sleeper and Mach.I dont drink BUUUUT when I do 3to4times a year x-mas partys and things like that I just make sure that I drink good booze and plenty of it When I wake up the next day I still have buzz and if I dont well have one more drink <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">and every thing is HUNKY DORY  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
Z||000007||p4n1c||09-03-2001||12:21 AM||||I drink an equal amount of water to the amount of alcohol consumed.  I never wake up with a hangover unless I don't drink the water.  Some the moral of the story is, water is your friend.||||reg||1
