Z||000012||JSocha||09-04-2001||09:21 AM||||Johnny, I was pretty drunk by the time we got to the party and I tried an "Atom Bomb".  I wish I knew what was in them as they were SWEET!  "Extremly" sweet and killer to boot   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/tongue.gif">.<P>But as far as what she cooked up, I know two of the ingrediants had to be Peto Bismo and Alka Seltzer.  For the most part though, I was down stairs on the basement couch trying not to move while she was upstairs in the kitchen.  Couch spins yah know!<P>Oy Vey!  I just recalled the hurling that occcured afterwards!   <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/smiley_drunk.gif">  So, I don't think I want to ever know now what was in that elixor.    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/frown.gif"><P>------------------<BR>    <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/jsocha_2.gif">  <p>[This message has been edited by JSocha (edited 09-04-2001).]||||reg||9
